# Keeps a `docker build` whose context is this checkout to the sources: no
# history, build output, agent worktrees or installed test tooling. The
# image (Containerfile) isn't built from here: `just image` builds it from a
# folder of unpacked release archives, so it holds the release's binary and
# nothing of this checkout.
.git
**/target
.worktrees
**/node_modules
mutants.out*
ui-tests/reports
